              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rosbiratschka is a German trick-taking compendium game for three or four players using a 32- or 24-card pack."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rosbiratschka is documented as a distinct traditional card game with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
